  "description": "Pure managed ADO.NET driver for IBM Netezza Performance Server (NPS): synchronous and asynchronous queries, streaming, connection pooling, TLS, catalog metadata, timeouts and structured server diagnostics. No ODBC bridge or native client required.",
  "iconFile": "images/netezza-driver-icon.png",
