  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.12.3: cross-driver sslmode (disable/prefer/require/verify-ca/verify-full) with a CA bundle instead of a client certificate, CharVarcharEncoding=latin1/utf8 for DBOS CHAR/VARCHAR, deterministic NUMERIC typing (decimal up to 28 digits, exact string above), ReadCommitted-only transactions, zero FieldCount for non-query readers, schema caches invalidated on NextResult, server-auth EKU enforcement for custom CAs, faster async reads of buffered rows, and invariant parsing of exact NUMERIC catalog text.",
